ClassifyArgModuleDoc
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: Classifies a single parser argument token into a SIR operand: determines kind (ref/const/null/global) and val (name, number, string, or bool), expanding nested brackets/quotes. Returns map {kind, val}.
    Provides: ClassifyArg(token) -> operand.
    DependsOn: none (leaf in module dependencies)
    Composition: Native Include from modules/Compiler/Compiler.sir (Path: ../ClassifyArg/ClassifyArg.sir).
